# Panel 230's R2 (M-panic-location step 10): two arrays that differ only past
# the sixteen elements a side writes are written alike, and the report says
# why, which an `==` alone is owed.

function main()
    xs = range(from: 0, to: 20)
    ys: [i64] @= range(from: 0, to: 20)
    ys[19] @ 99
    assert xs == ys
